</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#3333FF;--ltx-fill-color:#D9D9FF;" fill="#D9D9FF" stroke="#3333FF"><path d="M 238.65 307.09 L 139.3 307.09 C 137.01 307.09 135.15 305.23 135.15 302.93 L 135.15 263.99 C 135.15 261.7 137.01 259.84 139.3 259.84 L 238.65 259.84 C 240.94 259.84 242.8 261.7 242.8 263.99 L 242.8 302.93 C 242.8 305.23 240.94 307.09 238.65 307.09 Z M 135.15 259.84"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 139.76 287.44)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:7.69em;--ltx-fo-height:0.63em;--ltx-fo-depth:1.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="25.25" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="106.41"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
