<section id="S4.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection"><span id="S4.SS3.4" class="ltx_text">IV-C</span> </span><span id="S4.SS3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Ablation Studies</span></h3>

<div id="S4.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S4.T4" title="TABLE IV ‣ IV-C Ablation Studies ‣ IV Experimental Evaluation ‣ LLM4Rec: Large Language Models for Multimodal Generative Recommendation with Causal Debiasing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">IV</span></a> presents detailed ablation study results, demonstrating the contribution of each framework component. The results show that multimodal fusion provides the largest performance gain, followed by causal debiasing and retrieval augmentation.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE IV: </span>Ablation Study Results on MovieLens-25M Dataset</figcaption>
